  0084:  showTextbox "Which one do you want?\n"
  00b6:  showTextbox "Help me on my next request.\n"
  00f2:  showTextbox "<SELECTED TRACK>, right?\n"
  010a:  showTextbox "Why don't you request a\nnumber that will make me hot?\n"
  017a:  showTextbox "Where should I take you?\n"
  01b0:  showTextbox "I think that going yourself\nmay be the best way.\n"
  0216:  showTextbox "Are you sure? Once you go,\nI can't take you back.\n"
  027e:  showTextbox "I know\nCancel\n"
  029e:  showTextbox "I'm a collector. If you got\na thing I want, I'll trade.\n"
  0312:  showTextbox "What will you give me?\n"
  0344:  showTextbox "I'll trade all the time,\nso bring whatever you got.\n"
  03b0:  showTextbox "You'll really give me <SELECTED ITEM>?\n"
  03e6:  showTextbox "Yeah\nWell..., no\n"
  040c:  showTextbox "Thanks!\n"
  0420:  showTextbox "Too many Items.\n"
  0444:  showTextbox "I want You have\n"
  0468:  showTextbox "<YELLOW>Jijimon <WHITE>\nI'm Jijimon. Tell me\nabout yourself.\n"
  04cc:  showTextbox "<YELLOW>Jijimon <WHITE>\nDo you have a Digivice?\n"
  0516:  showTextbox "<LIGHTBLUE><PLAYER><WHITE>\nYes\nNo\n"
  0530:  showTextbox "<YELLOW>Jijimon <WHITE>\nI see.\n"
  0558:  showTextbox "<YELLOW>Jijimon <WHITE>\nNext question. Which do you\nlike better, day or night?\n"
  05e0:  showTextbox "<LIGHTBLUE><PLAYER><WHITE>\nDay\nNight\n"
  0600:  showTextbox "<YELLOW>Jijimon <WHITE>\nI see.\n"
  0628:  showTextbox "<YELLOW>Jijimon <WHITE>\nDo you have friends?\n"
  066c:  showTextbox "<LIGHTBLUE><PLAYER><WHITE>\nYes\nNo\n"
  0686:  showTextbox "<YELLOW>Jijimon <WHITE>\nAlright.\n"
  06b2:  showTextbox "<YELLOW>Jijimon <WHITE>\nWhat's your name?\n"
  06f0:  showTextbox "<YELLOW>Jijimon <WHITE>\n<LIGHTBLUE><PLAYER><WHITE>, right?\n"
  0722:  showTextbox "<LIGHTBLUE><PLAYER><WHITE>\nYes\nNo\n"
  073c:  showTextbox "<YELLOW>Jijimon <WHITE>\nWhat's your Digimon's name?\n"
